Package: geocheats
Version: 1.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: GeoCheats contributors
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), xdg-utils
Recommends: libx11-6
Description: Local Geometry Dash mod controller and Dash authoring tool
 Controls open in the installed browser. Gameplay targets Windows GD under
 Proton/Wine; process access depends on existing OS permissions.
